{"3475080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roulette Heist", "steam_appid": 3475080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/ce8baedbfc8ac3475a895100f20fcc34.poster.avif?t=1765545635\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/ce8baedbfc8ac3475a895100f20fcc34.webm?t=1765545635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/ce8baedbfc8ac3475a895100f20fcc34.mp4?t=1765545635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roulette Heist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Roulette Heist</i>, where deception, strategy, and raw courage collide in a high-stakes battle for survival.</strong> <strong>Fight for fortune and your life across Three intense modes: <i>Loot Division, </i>the brutal <i>Poker Roulette </i>and the coming <i>Death 21</i>  .</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/92940f478ed805838e513b42e058ce41.avif?t=1765545635\" width=750 height=360 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Poker Roulette Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Texas Hold'em Meets Russian Roulette:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hand of poker is a gamble with your life. Lose, and you'll face the barrel of a loaded revolver.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullets Are Currency:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only six bullets to start, each bet comes at a cost. Raise, fold, or go all-in—just make sure you can back it up.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Escape for Cowards:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fold a hand? Prepare to pull the trigger. Survive an empty shot, and you reload with even more bullets for the next round.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winner Takes All:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round ends with winners clearing their guns and losers facing death. Play continues until only one player remains standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/ac535c0e72741124dec16d9013c0307f.poster.avif?t=1765545635\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/ac535c0e72741124dec16d9013c0307f.webm?t=1765545635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/ac535c0e72741124dec16d9013c0307f.mp4?t=1765545635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/2649eb2fb7e7bbba1d57db585854ccaf.avif?t=1765545635\" width=750 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot Division Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Loot is On:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loot is laid out for all to see—gold bars, stacks of cash, and priceless artwork. The spoils are up for grabs, but only the bravest will make it out alive with the most.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Strategy:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with two powerful items every round—handcuffs, cigars, poison, adrenaline shots, and more.  Use them wisely—every move could be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Showdown Moment</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s do or die. Four blank shots, two live rounds. Will youshoot someone else to stay safe, or take the risk and target yourself? Every move is a gamble—one wrong decision, and you’re out.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot or Death:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the dust settles, the loot is up for grabs. The more valuable the prize, the bigger the target on your back. Hold your ground, outsmart your rivals, and take the loot. Only one will walk away with it all.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Standing:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive five intense rounds of risk and decision-making. The player with the most loot at the end is the ultimate winner, but beware—one wrong move could cost you everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/854abf3cf3a6edc9be4d7db74e6329fe.poster.avif?t=1765545635\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/854abf3cf3a6edc9be4d7db74e6329fe.webm?t=1765545635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475080/extras/854abf3cf3a6edc9be4d7db74e6329fe.mp4?t=1765545635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Your mask hides your face, but not your fear.&quot;</strong></h2>", "about_the_game"